                    7–8, 1937; see <ref target="frus1937v03#pg_128">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1937, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>, pp. 128</ref> ff., and <ref
                        target="frus1931-41v01#pg_313">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp. 313</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
